OL,3,GNEWSASecond man charged in connection
OL,4,Awith stab murder
OL,5,
OL,6,FA second man has been charged with
OL,7,Fconspiracy to murder following the
OL,8,Fdeath of a man who was fatally stabbed
OL,9,Foutside his house.
OL,11,FZeshaan Shaukat, 34, died in hospital
OL,12,Fon 28 August, three days after being
OL,13,Fattacked on Ashville Avenue, Hodge
OL,14,FHill, Birmingham, police said.
OL,16,FTyrell Phillips, 23, is due to appear
OL,17,Fat Birmingham Magistrates' Court, said
OL,18,FWest Midlands Police.
OL,20,FMohammed Rakeeb Shafi, aged 26 and of
OL,21,Fno fixed address, was also charged with
OL,22,Fthe same offence on Thursday.
